    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_title">About NPP Tracker</string>
    <string name="about_body">Shows the daily power level of every commercial nuclear power reactor licensed by the U.S. Nuclear Regulatory Commission.\n\nPower levels come from the NRC Power Reactor Status Report. Each value is the unit\'s power as a percentage of its licensed thermal power, as of the morning of the report date. Unit details come from the NRC list of operating reactors.\n\nThermal output figures are estimates (licensed MWt × reported power).\n\nThis app is not affiliated with or endorsed by the NRC.</string>
